msgid "中间的大树不能点击。先处理与它相连的三条根系。"
msgstr "The large tree in the center cannot be clicked. Start with the three roots connected to it."

msgid "箭头指着其中一条根系末端的锚点。"
msgstr "The arrow points to an anchor at the end of one root."

msgid "小芽：锚点周围照常扫雷"
msgstr "Sprout: Use Normal Minesweeper Around Each Anchor"

msgid "翻开锚点旁的安全格，把污染核心全部标对。"
msgstr "Reveal safe cells beside the anchor and flag every Pollution Core correctly."

msgid "三条根系都切断后，中间的大树会自动净化。"
msgstr "Once all three roots are severed, the central tree purifies itself."

msgid "小芽：生态扫描已经充满"
msgstr "Sprout: Eco Scan Is Fully Charged"

msgid "翻开格子和首次标记都能充能，能量还能带到下一关。"
msgstr "Reveals and first-time flags charge it, and stored energy carries into the next level."

msgid "小芽：按C选择一个隐藏格"
msgstr "Sprout: Press C and Choose a Hidden Cell"

msgid "扫描会直接告诉你，这一格是安全还是污染。"
msgstr "The scan tells you directly whether that cell is safe or polluted."

msgid "充满后，你可以使用一次生态扫描。"
msgstr "Once fully charged, you can use one Eco Scan."

msgid "小芽：海洋棋盘是六边形"
msgstr "Sprout: The Ocean Board Uses Hexagons"

msgid "每个格子最多只有六个相邻格，不再是原来的八个。"
msgstr "Each cell has at most six neighbors instead of eight."

msgid "只要按照六个方向读数字就可以了。"
msgstr "Read each number using the six hexagonal directions."

msgid "小芽：扫雷规则没有变化"
msgstr "Sprout: The Minesweeper Rules Are Unchanged"

msgid "浮标也能正常翻开、标记和双击展开。"
msgstr "Buoys can still be revealed, flagged, and expanded with a double-click."

msgid "小芽：珊瑚墙会隔开两格"
msgstr "Sprout: Coral Walls Separate Two Cells"

msgid "墙两边的格子不再相邻，数字也不会计算墙对面。"
msgstr "Cells on opposite sides of a wall are not adjacent, and numbers ignore the other side."

msgid "先看清墙在哪两格之间，再判断数字。"
msgstr "First see which two cells the wall separates, then read the numbers."

msgid "小芽：可以从墙边绕过去"
msgstr "Sprout: You Can Go Around the Wall"

msgid "没有被墙隔开的共享边，仍然保持正常相邻。"
msgstr "Any shared edge not blocked by a wall remains normally adjacent."

msgid "双击展开时，同样不会穿过珊瑚墙。"
msgstr "Double-click expansion will not cross a coral wall either."

msgid "小芽：浅蓝浮标会向右漂"
msgstr "Sprout: The Pale-Blue Buoys Drift Right"

msgid "每组有四个浮标，其中两个安全，另外两个是水雷。"
msgstr "Each group has four buoys: two are safe and two are mines."

msgid "小芽：要在漂出前解决它"
msgstr "Sprout: Solve Each Group Before It Escapes"

msgid "翻开两个安全浮标，并标出两颗水雷，这组就会停下。"
msgstr "Reveal both safe buoys and flag both mines to stop that group."

msgid "未解决的水雷漂出右侧边界，本局就会失败。"
msgstr "You lose if an unresolved mine drifts beyond the right boundary."

msgid "小芽：移动后数字会重算"
msgstr "Sprout: Numbers Recalculate After Every Move"

msgid "浮标每次移动，周围数字都会按新位置更新。"
msgstr "Whenever the buoys move, nearby numbers update for their new positions."

msgid "已经翻开的数字也可能跟着发生变化。"
msgstr "Even revealed numbers may change with them."

msgid "小芽：棋盘会分区退潮"
msgstr "Sprout: The Tide Reveals the Board in Zones"

msgid "现在只能操作亮起的区域，后面的区域暂时锁着。"
msgstr "Only the lit zone is available now; later zones remain locked."

msgid "先把当前区域的所有安全格翻开。"
msgstr "Reveal every safe cell in the current zone first."

msgid "小芽：完成后会打开下一区"
msgstr "Sprout: Completing a Zone Opens the Next"

msgid "新区出现时，交界处已经翻开的数字会重新计算。"
msgstr "When a new zone opens, revealed numbers along the boundary recalculate."

msgid "若没有解锁，状态栏会提示遗漏或错误标记。"
msgstr "If the next zone stays locked, the status bar shows missed cells or wrong flags."

msgid "小芽：这次棋盘变成了球"
msgstr "Sprout: This Board Is a Sphere"

msgid "云球没有边界，转到背面后仍是同一张棋盘。"
msgstr "The cloud sphere has no edge; the far side is still part of the same board."

msgid "只有共享一条边的云格才算相邻。"
msgstr "Only cloud faces sharing an edge are adjacent."

msgid "小芽：先学会转动云球"
msgstr "Sprout: Learn to Rotate the Cloud Sphere"

msgid "鼠标拖拽或W S A D旋转，方向键切换选中的云格。"
msgstr "Drag with the mouse or use W S A D to rotate; use the arrow keys to change the selected face."

msgid "J翻开、K标记，扫雷规则和之前一样。"
msgstr "J reveals and K flags; all other Minesweeper rules stay the same."

msgid "小芽：这一关会出现微风"
msgstr "Sprout: A Breeze May Appear Here"

msgid "你翻开安全格时，微风有时会额外处理一个隐藏格。"
msgstr "When you reveal a safe face, the breeze may resolve one extra hidden face."

msgid "它会翻开安全格，或自动标出污染。"
msgstr "It reveals a safe face or automatically flags pollution."

msgid "小芽：云球会转向目标"
msgstr "Sprout: The Sphere Turns Toward the Target"

msgid "微风触发后，画面会转到发生变化的那一格。"
msgstr "When the breeze triggers, the view rotates to the affected face."

msgid "这是随机帮助，其他判断仍由你完成。"
msgstr "This is random assistance; all other deductions are still yours."

msgid "小芽：这一关有一次云盾"
msgstr "Sprout: This Level Has a Cloud Shield"

msgid "如果误触污染，云盾有可能帮你挡住这次失败。"
msgstr "If you hit pollution, the Cloud Shield may prevent that failure."

msgid "每局最多成功一次，而且不保证触发。"
msgstr "It can succeed at most once per game and is not guaranteed to trigger."

msgid "小芽：触发后会自动标记"
msgstr "Sprout: A Blocked Core Is Flagged Automatically"

msgid "被云盾挡住的污染格会直接留下标记。"
msgstr "A polluted face blocked by the shield receives a flag automatically."

msgid "云盾只是保护，最好仍然根据数字推理。"
msgstr "The shield is only protection; you should still reason from the numbers."

msgid "小芽：安全数字上出现了雷眼"
msgstr "Sprout: A Storm Eye Appeared on a Safe Number"

msgid "雷眼可能藏在云球背面，边缘箭头会指向它。"
msgstr "A Storm Eye may hide on the far side; an edge arrow points toward it."

msgid "雷眼所在的格子本身是安全的。"
msgstr "The face holding the Storm Eye is safe."

msgid "小芽：正确标完周围污染"
msgstr "Sprout: Flag Every Nearby Core Correctly"

msgid "确认雷眼周围的污染都已标记后，双击雷眼数字。"
msgstr "After flagging every core around the Storm Eye, double-click its number."

msgid "一共击破三个雷眼，就能完成这一关。"
msgstr "Break all three Storm Eyes to complete the level."

msgid "小芽：宇宙棋盘要看连线"
msgstr "Sprout: Follow the Links in the Universe"

msgid "两颗星核之间有线才算相邻，距离远近并不重要。"
msgstr "Two star cores are adjacent only when a line connects them; distance does not matter."

msgid "没有连线的星核互不影响。"
msgstr "Star cores without a connecting line do not affect each other."

msgid "小芽：直线和弧线都有效"
msgstr "Sprout: Straight and Curved Links Both Count"

msgid "银灰色直线和青蓝色弧线都表示正常相邻。"
msgstr "Silver straight lines and cyan arcs both indicate normal adjacency."

msgid "数字是所有直接相连星核中的污染总数。"
msgstr "A number counts pollution among every directly connected star core."

msgid "小芽：星舰有两层护盾"
msgstr "Sprout: The Starship Has Two Shield Layers"

msgid "误触污染会消耗一层护盾，并自动标记那颗星核。"
msgstr "Hitting pollution consumes one shield layer and flags that star core automatically."

msgid "两层护盾都用完后，再误触才会结束远征。"
msgstr "After both layers are gone, the next polluted core ends the expedition."

msgid "小芽：紫色连线是虫洞"
msgstr "Sprout: Purple Links Are Wormholes"

msgid "虫洞两端的星核即使离得很远，也算直接相邻。"
msgstr "Star cores at the two ends of a wormhole are directly adjacent, however far apart they appear."

msgid "数字会把虫洞另一端的污染计算进去。"
msgstr "Numbers include pollution at the far end of a wormhole."

msgid "小芽：把它当成普通连线"
msgstr "Sprout: Treat It Like Any Other Link"

msgid "判断数字时，沿紫色线找到另一端一起计算。"
msgstr "When reading a number, follow the purple line and include its other endpoint."

msgid "除了距离很远，规则和其他连线完全相同。"
msgstr "Apart from the long distance, it follows exactly the same rules as any other link."

