msgstr "All live mines in %d groups intercepted · Drifting stopped"

msgid "\n方向键 / W S A D 移动 · J净化 · K标记 · C扫描"
msgstr "\nMove Arrows/WASD · J Reveal · K Flag · C Scan"

msgid "两圈污染场已全部处理 · 漂流污染源净化完成"
msgstr "Both pollution rings cleared · Drifting source purified"

msgid "两格必须共享一条边才算相邻。"
msgstr "Two cells are adjacent only when they share an edge."

msgid "例如 1 表示周围有 1 个污染核心"
msgstr "For example, 1 means one adjacent Pollution Core"

msgid "再左键翻开一个白色格"
msgstr "Left-click another white cell"

msgid "净化时间\n00:00.0\n\n污染核心    0/%d\n\n净化状态\n准备中"
msgstr "Clear Time\n00:00.0\n\nPollution Cores    0/%d\n\nStatus\nReady"

msgid "净化目标\n清除所有污染核心\n恢复%s生态\n\n"
msgstr "Objective\nClear every Pollution Core\nRestore the %s ecosystem\n\n"

msgid "前面出现了新的生态变化。"
msgstr "A new ecological change has appeared ahead."

msgid "双击这个数字"
msgstr "Double-click this number"

msgid "取消"
msgstr "Cancel"

msgid "右键取消这个错误标记"
msgstr "Right-click to remove this wrong flag"

msgid "右键放下检测种子"
msgstr "Right-click to place a detection seed"

msgid "它不会自动翻开或标记，之后仍由你决定。"
msgstr "It does not reveal or flag anything automatically; the next choice is still yours."

msgid "小芽带你认识棋盘"
msgstr "Sprout Introduces the Board"

msgid "左键净化\n右键污染标记\n点击数字展开\n\n紫色弧线也是邻接\n会连接远距离星核\n\n首次净化保护\n附近两颗邻星\n误触核心消耗护盾\n\n航行越深\n星网结构越丰富"
msgstr "Left: Reveal\nRight: Pollution Flag\nClick Numbers to Expand\n\nPurple Arcs Are Adjacent\nThey Link Distant Star Cores\n\nFirst Reveal Protection\nCovers Two Nearby Stars\nHitting a Core Uses Shield\n\nDeeper Voyages\nCreate Richer Star Webs"

msgid "左键翻开这个安全建议格"
msgstr "Left-click this suggested safe cell"

msgid "当前关卡：01 萌芽"
msgstr "Current Level: 01 Sprout"

msgid "快速展开"
msgstr "Quick Expand"

msgid "所以数字里既可能有普通污染，也可能包含节点。"
msgstr "A number may therefore count both ordinary pollution and a node."

msgid "扫描 C"
msgstr "Scan C"

msgid "找到数字后，清扫者会继续说明"
msgstr "The sweeper will continue after you find a number"

msgid "把数字周围的污染核心全部标记"
msgstr "Flag every Pollution Core around the number"

msgid "拖拽旋转 · 左键净化 · 右键标记 · 方向键选择 · W S A D旋转 · J翻开 · K标记"
msgstr "Drag: Rotate · Left: Reveal · Right: Flag · Arrows: Select · W S A D: Rotate · J: Reveal · K: Flag"

msgid "拖拽旋转 · 左键净化 · 右键标记\n"
msgstr "Drag: Rotate · Left: Reveal · Right: Flag\n"

msgid "按 Enter 或点下一步继续"
msgstr "Press Enter or click Next to continue"

msgid "按 K 取消这个错误标记"
msgstr "Press K to remove this wrong flag"

msgid "按 K 放下检测种子"
msgstr "Press K to place a detection seed"

msgid "数字仍表示相邻格里一共有多少个污染。"
msgstr "A number still shows the total pollution in adjacent cells."

msgid "无效启动参数；请使用 --level=1 至 --level=21 或 --universe。"
msgstr "Invalid launch argument; use --level=1 through --level=21 or --universe."

msgid "林缘"
msgstr "Forest Edge"

msgid "标记已用完 · 若仍发现水雷，请检查是否有错误标记"
msgstr "All flags are in use · If a mine remains, check for a wrong flag"

msgid "标记正确后，会展开周围安全格"
msgstr "Correct flags will expand the surrounding safe cells"

msgid "检测种子"
msgstr "Detection Seed"

